  "verified_assertions": [
    "The P1 Skill Manifest is closed to instructions-only content; script fields are rejected and executionMode is always INSTRUCTIONS_ONLY.",
    "allowedTools is advisory metadata and never grants C06 or C16 authority.",
    "Every release is bound to canonical content SHA-256, source-review evidence and a frozen evaluation-report bundle.",
    "The Registry independently recomputes evaluation binding and F04 precedence rather than trusting an embedded PASS label.",
    "Untested, unevaluated, failed, unapproved, unpublished, hash-mismatched or withdrawn releases cannot resolve for a new Run.",
    "Approval repeats the exact evaluation-report and human-baseline decision hashes.",
    "PILOT and STABLE channels use generation CAS; withdrawal clears current pointers and rollback accepts only an eligible previously published release.",
    "Each command is Tenant-scoped, idempotent and paired with one append-only event and receipt.",
    "C06 operation-specific authorization is checked before storage; a grant for one lifecycle operation cannot authorize another.",
    "The PostgreSQL runtime is non-owner and NOBYPASSRLS, cannot delete history, and cannot combine runtime with C07 scope-signing authority.",
    "All four checked-in Synthetic releases remain BLOCKED because their report bundles contain zero case results; no release is falsely represented as runnable."
